data: {"id": "d38cc4d9b5fa4c69-final", "run_id": "d38cc4d9b5fa4c69", "seq": 1144, "ts_ms": 1788775139230, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p 处于 Pending 阶段，容器状态 Waiting (CreateContainerConfigError)；kubelet 报错无法在 Secret workload-input 中找到 key unavailable-key，导致容器配置失败，应用未启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (Warning Failed, x12 over 25m) | 直接证明容器配置阶段因 Secret Key 缺失被 Kubelet 阻断。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `Pod status: Pending`, `container restart_count: 0` | 确认 Pod 处于等待阶段，且应用容器尚未发生过重启。 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: `CreateContainerConfigError`) = 1 | 从监控指标维度印证 K8s 事件的异常分类。 |\n\n上述证据形成闭环：`K8s Event` 提供了缺失 `workload-input/unavailable-key` 的具体报错原文，与 `Metric` 中的 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态完全对应，确证根因为配置项不可用，而非资源不足或其他网络问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPod Spec 引用了不存在的 Secret Key (aiops-case-04/workload-input 中的 unavailable-key) → Kubelet 在容器创建阶段验证 Secret 配置失败 → 容器启动被强制阻止，状态保持为 Waiting (CreateContainerConfigError) → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为 **Secret 引用错误**。\n`aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在 `unavailable-key`，导致 Pod `workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` 无法完成配置加载（见证据 #1、#3）。该配置错误直接阻断了容器的启动流程，使得应用无法运行。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 27.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p: 38.9s (Evidence 30.4s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 72.889, "metrics": {"run_id": "d38cc4d9b5fa4c69", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 72.89574098587036, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 72895.74098587036, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 66688.66658210754, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 15211.64846420288, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5892.730236053467}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 27713.481426239014, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 38875.189781188965, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 6285.228967666626, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

